          [Designation]<br/>
          Dept. of Computer Applications
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <br/><br/><br/>
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;">ACADEMIC YEAR 2025–2026</p>
  </div>

  <br clear="all" style="page-break-before:always" />

  <!-- CERTIFICATE -->
  <h1>CERTIFICATE OF ORIGINALITY</h1>
  <p>This is to certify that the project entitled <strong>"[TITLE OF PROJECT]"</strong> submitted by <strong>[Student Names & Roll Numbers]</strong> in partial fulfillment of the requirements for the award of the degree of <strong>Bachelor of Computer Applications</strong> at Dev Bhoomi Uttarakhand University, is a bonafide record of original work carried out by them under my supervision and guidance.</p>
  <p>To the best of my knowledge, the matter embodied in this report has not been submitted to any other University or Institute for the award of any degree or diploma.</p>
  
