        ___________________________<br/>
        <strong>Head of Department</strong><br/>
        School of Computer Applications<br/>
        DBUU, Dehradun
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <br clear="all" style="page-break-before:always" />

  <!-- DECLARATION -->
  <h1>DECLARATION</h1>
  <p>We hereby declare that this project report entitled <strong>"[TITLE OF PROJECT]"</strong> is our own original work done under the guidance of <strong>[Supervisor Name]</strong>, Department of Computer Applications, Dev Bhoomi Uttarakhand University. We have properly acknowledged and cited all references and sources used in this work.</p>
