  <!-- TABLE OF CONTENTS SKELETON -->
  <h1>TABLE OF CONTENTS</h1>
  <p><em>(Auto-generate in Microsoft Word via References &gt; Table of Contents)</em></p>
  <p><strong>1. Introduction</strong> ......................................................................................... 1</p>
  <p><strong>2. Literature Survey</strong> .................................................................................... 6</p>
  <p><strong>3. System Analysis & Requirement Specifications</strong> ............................................ 12</p>
  <p><strong>4. System Design & Architectural Modeling</strong> .................................................... 18</p>
  <p><strong>5. Implementation & Modules</strong> ...................................................................... 28</p>
  <p><strong>6. Testing & Results</strong> ..................................................................................... 38</p>
  <p><strong>7. Conclusion & Scope for Future Work</strong> .......................................................... 45</p>
  <p><strong>References (IEEE Style)</strong> ............................................................................... 48</p>

  <br clear="all" style="page-break-before:always" />

  <!-- CHAPTER 1 -->
  <h2>CHAPTER 1: INTRODUCTION</h2>
  <p>[Detailed introduction of the project, problem background, motivational context, targeted objectives, and report layout overview.]</p>

  <h2>CHAPTER 2: LITERATURE SURVEY</h2>
  <p>[Review of 4-6 existing research papers, commercial applications, or competitor software. Highlight the research gap and how your project addresses the identified shortcomings.]</p>

  <h2>CHAPTER 3: SYSTEM REQUIREMENT ANALYSIS</h2>
  <p>[Functional requirements, non-functional requirements (speed, security, responsiveness), and feasibility study (technical, economic, operational).] </p>

  <h2>CHAPTER 4: SYSTEM DESIGN & ARCHITECTURE</h2>
  <p>[Include System Architecture Diagram, Entity Relationship (ER) Diagram, Data Flow Diagram (Level 0, Level 1), Database Table schema specifications, and UI Wireframes.]</p>

  <h2>CHAPTER 5: IMPLEMENTATION DETAILS</h2>
  <p>[Discuss frontend and backend implementation, key algorithms, API endpoints, authentication flows, and screenshot walkthroughs with captions.]</p>

  <h2>CHAPTER 6: SYSTEM TESTING & VALIDATION</h2>
  <p>[Test cases, Unit Testing, Integration Testing, User Acceptance Testing (UAT), and validation matrices with Pass/Fail status.]</p>

  <h2>CHAPTER 7: CONCLUSION & FUTURE SCOPE</h2>
  <p>[Summary of project achievements against original objectives and planned future feature expansions.]</p>
</div>
